{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事前に駅の階段を\n登っていたら急に後ろから\nおじいさんに話しかけられて\nなんだろう？と思ったら\n「靴置いてってますよ！」\nって言われて数段下の階段を\n見たら私の靴が片っぽ脱げて\n落ちてました(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脱げて歩いてたことに\n気づかなかったみたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でもびっくり(OωO )(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもこんな経験ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/17/9296081/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月と∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて今日は1日\n映画「心が叫びたがってるんだ。」\nの舞台挨拶に登壇させて\nいただきました(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして吉田尚記アナウンサーが\n1日MCを務めてくださいました☆\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアニメの舞台挨拶と\nいうことでまっつんが\n一段とイキイキしていて\n可愛かったよー(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画は絶賛公開中なので\nぜひ劇場に足を運んで\nここさけの切なく甘酸っぱい\n青春の世界感に浸ってください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今話したい誰かに\n心の叫びを伝えてみてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑上手いこと\n言ってません？(b・ω・d)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆オフショット〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/17/9296081/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/17/9296081/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は太陽ノックラストの\n個別握手会です(∩^ω^∩)、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々だ〜♪\n早く明日になって欲しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン前の握手会ということで\nコスプレをするメンバーも\n多いのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏は？って？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーしよっかなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁするかしないかは\n来てからのお楽しみ♡ってことで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(きっと真夏のことだから\nそんなこといいつつ\n絶対するんだろ〜とか\n思ったでしょー？(*￢ε￢*)\nでももしかしたらその裏を\nついて意外と普通に\n私服かもしれませんよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日を楽しみにしながら\n寝たいと思います(。-ω-)｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1〜5部 待ってるねっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/17/9296081/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみーん☆\n最近よく話す気がする(｡・v・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんは本当に周りを\n明るくしてくれる素敵な人です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂46SHOW！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10／24放送の乃木坂46SHOW！\nで再びメイドコントをやらせて\nいただきます(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は第3弾です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日収録して来たんだけど\n衣装のメイド服に着替えていたら\n「真夏の勝負服だね♡」と\nみなみに言われました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も前回、前々回同様に\nゲストに六角慎司さんが\nきてくださってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドはみなみ,飛鳥,まりか,\nにゃんさん,私の5人(　・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで髪型もお揃いにしたよ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国のご主人様っ♡\nお見逃しなく(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/17/9296081/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぇい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(^^)"}],"source":"archive"}